# Deny everything, then allow only what the image needs. A new file stays out by default, so personal
# data (data/history.json, reports/, private/, scripts/retro_content.py) and the private question bank
# (banks/) can't reach an image by accident. The bank is mounted at run time (compose.yaml).
*
!app.py
!VERSION
!LICENSE
!requirements.lock
!.streamlit/config.toml
!src/
!scripts/kb.py
!scripts/check_network.py
!data/study_links.json
**/__pycache__
